@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@userId = 407

### 1 Add Clean Code (expect 201 Created, no body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart?userId={{userId}}&bookId=1

### 2 Add The Pragmatic Programmer (expect 201 Created, no body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart?userId={{userId}}&bookId=2

### 3 Retrieve persisted books (expect two Book objects)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart?userId={{userId}}

### 4 Retrieve subtotal (expect 74.98)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/subtotal?userId={{userId}}

### 5 Delete Clean Code (expect 204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart?userId={{userId}}&bookId=1

### 6 Confirm only book 2 remains
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart?userId={{userId}}

### 7 Optional invalid book test (expect 404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart?userId={{userId}}&bookId=999

